{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance karma in a living realm. In <strong>Karma Keepers</strong>\u00a0you're a newly born god guiding souls, keeping corruption under control, and growing a loop of channel energy -&gt; upgrade -&gt; automate to max out karma and defeat the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual energy fuels your realm,\u00a0<strong>pray, collect, and convert it into progress</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/eb6da8c63ed0a4ea835e165f3f73b82d.poster.avif?t=1767092305\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/eb6da8c63ed0a4ea835e165f3f73b82d.webm?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/eb6da8c63ed0a4ea835e165f3f73b82d.mp4?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Spend spiritual energy on blessings to <strong>specialize souls</strong> and <strong>boost efficiency.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/729d4148d4a1b884f089bc806cd8103a.poster.avif?t=1767092305\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/729d4148d4a1b884f089bc806cd8103a.webm?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/729d4148d4a1b884f089bc806cd8103a.mp4?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Let your <strong>souls handle the grind</strong> while you plan the next move.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b44db9702d7a57980baa9fa30061ea88.poster.avif?t=1767092305\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b44db9702d7a57980baa9fa30061ea88.webm?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b44db9702d7a57980baa9fa30061ea88.mp4?t=1767092305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Ready to keep the balance? Max out karma, banish the demons, and let the realm thrive. If you're in, <strong>add Karma Keepers to your wishlist</strong> and <strong>follow the game</strong> for updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979140?t=1767092305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979140?t=1767092305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/436b77ff52cbd58d3d6c762cb394bce7d7f5f937/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767092305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/436b77ff52cbd58d3d6c762cb394bce7d7f5f937/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767092305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance karma in a living realm. In <strong>Karma Keepers</strong>\u00a0you're a newly born god guiding souls, keeping corruption under control, and growing a loop of channel energy -&gt; upgrade -&gt; automate to max out karma and defeat the demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiritual energy fuels your realm,\u00a0<strong>pray, collect, and convert it into progress</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin